  "ruleClass": "unknown",
  "lead": "Distribution Group (Turkey)",
  "body": "Dear David,\n\nThank you for your email.\n\nAt the moment, we are fully covered in this product segment. However, if you \nhave offerings within personal care or hair care, please feel free to share \nthem with us.\n\nI look forward to hearing from you.\n\nBest regards,\nOkan Can\n\ntirs. 28. apr. 2026 kl. 3.15 PM skrev David I Daejin Park 박대진 \n<david@yogico.kr <mailto:david@yogico.kr> >:\n\nHi Okan,\n\nWe would like to introduce a promising K-beauty brand, Toun28, which has \nreceived investment from Amore pacific Ventures and, more recently, from \nIMM, an investor known for brands such as Medicube and Goodai Global. Based \non our experience evaluating a wide range of skincare brands, TOUN28 stands \nout for its exceptional texture, formulation quality, and overall user \nexperience. The best quality ever.\n\nWe believe the brand has strong potential to gain significant traction in \nthe near future. Please find the attached materials for your review.\n\nPlease let us know if you are interested in exploring partnership with \nToun28.\n\nBest Regards,\n\nDavid I Daejin Park  박대진, CEO\nYogi Corporation Inc.\n\nAddress: 201, 125, Bongeunsa-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul, Korea \n<https://www.google.com/maps/search/125,+Bongeunsa-ro,+Gangnam-gu,+Seoul,+Korea?entry=gmail&source=g>\nMobile: +82 10 6747 9443\n <http://www.yogico.kr/> www.yogico.kr\n\n  <https://wmail.ecount.com/ec5/api/app.webmail/action/ReadReceiptAction:6d736769643d32303236303432383232313435362e3931393536332e3338444130313726656d61696c3d6f6b616e40646973747269627574696f6e67726f75702e636f6d2e7472>",
