  "body": "Hello David,\n\nWe are leaving the hotel tomorrow morning, can you have it delivered by \ntoday?\n\ntors. 23. apr. 2026 kl. 16.48 skrev David / Daejin Park <david@yogico.kr \n<mailto:david@yogico.kr> >:\n\nYou will get them by tomorrow.\n\nBest Regards,\n\nDavid I Daejin Park\n\n <https://www.yogico.kr/> Yogi Corporation Inc.\n+82-10-6747-9443\n201, 125 Bongeunsa-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul, Republic of Korea \n<https://www.google.com/maps/search/125+Bongeunsa-ro,+Gangnam-gu,+Seoul,+Republic+of+Korea?entry=gmail&source=g> \n(06120)\n\nFrom: Okan Can <okan@distributiongroup.com.tr \n<mailto:okan@distributiongroup.com.tr> >\nSent: Thursday, April 23, 2026 12:39 PM\nTo: David I Daejin Park 박대진 <david@yogico.kr <mailto:david@yogico.kr> >\nCc: 이훈 <hoon@yogico.kr <mailto:hoon@yogico.kr> >; Junsu Han(한준수) \n<hjs@yogico.kr <mailto:hjs@yogico.kr> >\nSubject: Re: Re: [Yogico] Introducing Osstem Pharma & Vussen Business \nOverview\n\nHello David,\n\nJust 3-4 products in total, just send one of each reference.\n\nPlease have it delivered to our hotel during today, my room is 2020.\n\nSofitel Ambassador Seoul Hotel & Serviced Residences\n209 Jamsil-ro, Songpa District, Seoul, South Korea \n<https://www.google.com/maps/search/209+Jamsil-ro,+Songpa+District,+Seoul,+South+Korea?entry=gmail&source=g>\n\nBest Regards,\n\nOkan Can\n\ntors. 23. apr. 2026 kl. 09.32 skrev David I Daejin Park 박대진 \n<david@yogico.kr <mailto:david@yogico.kr> >:\n\nHi Okan,\n\nPlease let us know the address where we should send the samples, and we will \narrange it accordingly.\n\nIt would be appreciated if you could also let me know the required sample \nquantities.\n\nBest Regards,\n\nDavid I Daejin Park  박대진, CEO\n\nYogi Corporation Inc.\n\nAddress: 201, 125, Bongeunsa-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul, Korea \n<https://www.google.com/maps/search/125,+Bongeunsa-ro,+Gangnam-gu,+Seoul,+Korea?entry=gmail&source=g>\n\nMobile: +82 10 6747 9443\n\n <http://www.yogico.kr/> www.yogico.kr",
