 {
  "id": "6aa0d3a08f83165dc75cea32",
  "subject": "Re: [Yogico] Introducing Osstem Pharma & Vussen Business Overview",
  "from": "Okan Can <okan@distributiongroup.com.tr>",
  "to": "david@yogico.kr",
  "date": "2026-04-23",
  "folder": "INBOX.Distribution Group Turkey",
  "group": "Distribution Group Turkey",
  "hasAttach": 0,
  "ruleClass": "unknown",
  "lead": "Distribution Group (Turkey)",
  "body": "Hello David,\n\nThank you for your email.\n\nI’m glad you mentioned Marvis, as with the current pricing, the MSRP would \nbe higher than Marvis. This is the reason we have requested a 40% discount.\n\nAdditionally, could you please arrange to send us some samples? We would \nlike to bring them back with us for our presentation to retailers.\n\nBest regards,\nOkan Can\n\nOn Wed, Apr 22, 2026 at 7:29 PM David / Daejin Park <david@yogico.kr \n<mailto:david@yogico.kr> > wrote:\n\nHi Orkan,\n\nThe pricing previously shared is based on the terms offered to Normal, a \nleading European retailer operating approximately 1,000 stores across the \nregion.\n\nVussen is positioned similarly to Marvis, the Italian premium toothpaste \nbrand in terms of branding, while offering a more competitive price point \nand of course better quality.\n\nAs you can calculate, the current supply price is already at over 75% of the \nMSRP, which leaves no further room for reduction. In addition, products must \nnot be sold below the MSRP in retail channels.\n\nIf you would like to proceed under these conditions, please let us know. We \nare currently in discussions with multiple distributors as part of an \naggressive expansion into the European market. As such, this may be the best \nand only timing to discuss exclusivity for the Turkish market should you \nwish to move forward.\n\nBest regards,\n\nDavid I Daejin Park\n\n <https://www.yogico.kr/> Yogi Corporation Inc.\n+82-10-6747-9443\n201, 125 Bongeunsa-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul, Republic of Korea (06120)\n\nFrom: Okan Can <okan@distributiongroup.com.tr \n<mailto:okan@distributiongroup.com.tr> >\nSent: Wednesday, April 22, 2026 9:11 AM\nTo: David I Daejin Park 박대진 <david@yogico.kr <mailto:david@yogico.kr> >\nCc: 이훈 <hoon@yogico.kr <mailto:hoon@yogico.kr> >; Junsu Han(한준수) \n<hjs@yogico.kr <mailto:hjs@yogico.kr> >\nSubject: Re: [Yogico] Introducing Osstem Pharma & Vussen Business Overview\n\nHello David,\n\nThank you for your feedback.\n\nAt this stage, the pricing is still not at the level required for successful \nentry into the key retail channels. From our perspective, we would need to \ntarget approximately a 40% discount to ensure competitiveness.\n\nAchieving this level would enable us to proceed with launches in Watsons, \nRossmann, and Gratis, which together represent a network of over 1,500 doors \nand a significant growth opportunity for the brand in Turkey.\n\nPlease let us know your thoug",
  "truncated": true
 },
 {
  "id": "6aa0d3b28f83165dc75cea7b",
