  "group": "Osstem Pharma Vussen",
  "hasAttach": 3,
  "ruleClass": "unknown",
  "lead": "",
  "body": "Dear Ms. Camilla\n\nI was also very pleased to meet you on line.\nThere are major 2 inquiries.\n\n1) As we understood, we thought that Dangaard will make exclusive contract \nfor 4 countries only (Denmark, Sweden, Norway, and Finland). Except these \ncountries, do you need labels?\n\n2) This labels will be made by one country by one coutnry? OR Do you need \nall languages as a whole?\n\nPlease clarify these points. Thank you.\n\nWarm regards,\nJK Kim\n\n  <https://mall.denall.com/upload/mail/osstem_pharma.png>\nJK KIM Overseas Business / Manager\nOsstem Pharma Co., Ltd.\n34, Magokjungang 6-ro, Gangseo-gu, Seoul, Korea 07802\nTel. +82-70-5118-0330 Fax. +82-70-5118-0197 Mobile.+82-10-8994-0424\nnavy542@osstempharma.com www.osstempharma.com",
  "truncated": false
 },
