  "body": "Dear David,\n\nThank you very much for sharing the signed agreement — we confirm receipt \nand truly appreciate your support.\n\nRegarding the brands, we would like to confirm our interest in Age20’s, \nparticularly the cushion products (and other products from the brand with \nCPNP), as well as in the Signiq brand.\n\nWith respect to Farmstay (Myungin), we are interested in both product import \n& distribution and private label / brand development (ODM). We believe there \nis strong potential in exploring both directions.\n\nAs a matter of fact, we have just received a follow-up email from the \nFarmstay/Myungin team today after Cosmoprof. We will respond shortly and \nwill include you in the email, so that we can ensure a transparent and \naligned communication moving forward.\n\nRegarding our visit to Korea, we will revert shortly with the planned dates, \nbut I can assure you that we will not come between My 22 to 26.\n\nThank you once again for your support, and we look forward to the next \nsteps.\n\nKind regards,",
